     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046872">EVEX.128.66.0F38.W0 54 /r</para>
      <para unique="1046873">VPOPCNTB xmm1{k1}{z}, xmm2/m128</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046877">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046879">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046881">(AVX512_BITALG</para>
      <para unique="1046882">AND AVX512VL) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+251026"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046887">Counts the number of bits set to one in xmm2/m128 and puts the result in xmm1 with writemask k1.</para>
